WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
Bear

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,600
Throw out the few people who took the lead just now

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,900
Why are you driving me out?

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,700
Why did I do nothing?

5
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,500
Just because the hotel is mine and

6
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,700
You think I forgot you

7
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,300
You were the one grabbing food that day, right?

8
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:15,700
I was wrong, Boss Xia, to throw him directly into the funeral pile.

9
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:16,900
that was not my intention

10
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,900
I followed someone else's instigation.

11
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,500
Don't throw me into the funeral pile

12
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,060
Help, Boss Xia, I know I was wrong

13
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,460
Please give me a chance

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,460
Kill the chicken to Jinhou

15
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:27,660
I won’t restrain them today

16
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:43,350
Everyone will treat me like Prince Ruan and throw him out. Captain Qihua, I’m staying here.
